
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Capital City - Tor Veiloth's Sion Quarters.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Capital City - Tor Veiloth's Sion Quarters.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"6vfbg6","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776993304022,"size":1994,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"6vfbg6"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Locations - Capital City - Tor Veiloth's Sion Quarters":[20,21],"#The artistic and cultural heart of Tor Veiloth, rivaling the Palace District in its impressiveness.":[22,27],"#The artistic and cultural heart of Tor Veiloth, rivaling the Palace District in its impressiveness.#{1}":[23,27]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["sion quarter","sion","medichi family","hokkaid itsune","flowerboy school"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Sion Quarters (Tor Veiloth):**  \nThe artistic and cultural heart of Tor Veiloth, rivaling the Palace District. Governed by the Medichi family for generations. Rebuilt over a century ago in the style of ancient Kyoto (Miyazaki influence). A dense hub of high-end theaters, art galleries, and restaurants. Home to **Hokkaid_Itsune**, Flora's premier school for \"flowerboys\" (refined male courtesans/entertainers trained in arts, music, and companionship; some become husbands to wealthy women).  \n\n**When to select:**  \nScenes involving high culture, elite entertainment, artistic venues, the Medichi family, or the flowerboy institution.  \n\n**Key relationships:**  \n- Medichi family (ruling patrons)  \n- Hokkaid_Itsune (flowerboy school)  \n- Tor Veiloth (city district)"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Capital City - Tor Veiloth's Sion Quarters.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"l